WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.900
You... You're...

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:06.400
No...

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.370
Impossible!

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:18.910
Do you still intend to fight, young hero?

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:22.860
I admire your courage.

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.110
I need to tell them.

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:27.150
Yuki!

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:30.830
Say your prayers.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.240
Toko-chan.

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.160
Goodbye.

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:55.760
Only I know your pain...

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:58.270
Your uncertainty...

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:01.600
Your loneliness...

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:06.320
If only we could be together forever.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:12.740
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:22.920
I will not betray you!

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:18.070
How is Tsukumo-kun?

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:20.250
Yuki-chan...

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:24.650
Toko-san, it will be all right.
He'll be okay.

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:30.030
Doctor, how is Tsukumo?

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.790
Yuki, come with me.

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:35.580
Okay.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:47.760
That Which Is Fleeting,
Strong, and Precious

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:51.910
Using anti-demon magic and the Zweilt's
own regenerative abilities,

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:55.450
his external injuries can be
healed easily enough...

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:57.360
But I can't wake him.

00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:01.900
Miasma is consuming his body.

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:10.000
His powerful will to live is barely
keeping his heart pumping, and...

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:12.370
That's...

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:13.870
I heard you made this.

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:19.260
Apparently, when they found Tsukumo,
this necklace was glowing softly,

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:21.840
as though protecting him.

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:26.670
<i>Don't worry, Yuki.</i>

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:29.590
<i>We've got the charms
you made for us.</i>

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:32.800
Yuki.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:33.830
Yes?

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:38.990
I need your help. I know it will be
difficult for you, but-

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:40.140
I'll do it.

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:42.650
Please let me help you!

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:56.330
I'm sorry for making Yuki-chan suffer again.

00:04:57.010 --> 00:04:59.100
It's what Yuki wants.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:04.500
Tsukumo heard someone scream
and ran off to help.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:07.380
When he got there, he was attacked.

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:10.590
He's sensitive to other people's pain.

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:15.850
And because he's good at reading their emotions,
he puts them before himself.

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:18.930
And now he's badly injured...

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:20.620
Are you okay?

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:25.470
I'm fine!

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:27.860
I'm something of a big sister here.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.150
I've got to keep it together.

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:35.280
I'm not one of you.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:41.100
So you don't have to keep it
together for me.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:54.160
Then lend me your back for a while.

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:22.480
We can't keep doing this.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.000
Tsukumo's come to.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.720
Come in, everyone.

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:38.100
Tsukumo... Tsukumo!

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:41.160
Toko-chan...

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:42.570
Thank goodness...

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:45.100
You guys.

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:47.160
Be careful.

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:49.110
Reiga is...

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:50.570
Reiga?

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:52.940
Reiga is...

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:54.990
Tsukumo!

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:55.820
He's fine.

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:58.700
He's just sleeping.
He's out of the woods.

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:04.750
Thank you, Yuki-chan.

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.630
Thank you so much!

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:11.520
Yuki!

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:13.570
Yuki-chan!

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:14.300
Yuki! Wake up! Yuki-kun!
Hey!

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:14.570
Wake up! Yuki-chan!

00:07:14.570 --> 00:07:16.340
Yuki! Wake up! Yuki-kun!

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:22.260
So, Reiga appeared with
that Ashley girl, huh?

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:25.900
Is Tsukumo all right?

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:30.610
Yuki-chan spent the
whole night healing him.

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:33.940
But due to that, Yuki-chan...

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:39.330
That idiot! Always worrying about others!

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:43.330
You're awake.

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:46.560
Luka...

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:48.120
Are you okay?

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:50.710
I'm fine. It was nothing.

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:53.600
You should keep resting.

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:55.030
I really am fine.

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:58.850
I'm not tired or hurt.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:01.930
Just spit it out.

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:05.810
Give me everything you
can't carry on your own.

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:15.020
I didn't understand what it meant to fight.

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:23.280
I didn't understand the Duras or
what it meant to risk one's life.

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:29.110
But this actually happened to Tsukumo-kun...

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:32.180
I didn't really understand anything.

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:37.270
Everyone's doing what they can to help.

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:40.410
But I...

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:45.050
The tears you shed for the wounded...

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:47.060
That is your strength.

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:53.850
I'm not hungry.

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:55.530
Hotsuma-kun.

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:00.710
Yuki.

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:03.350
Are you...

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:04.770
I've removed the barrier.

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.720
Did Takashiro tell you to?

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:18.400
Let's go see Shusei-kun.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:21.630
Reiga...

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:24.510
That's what Tsukumo said?

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:25.650
Yes.

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:30.010
We don't have time for Opasts,
now that their leader has come to play.

00:09:30.010 --> 00:09:31.960
What should we do, boss?

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:36.150
They offered to trade Shusei for Yuki.

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:39.010
We can't accept those terms.

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:42.110
Then what will happen to Shusei-kun?

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:46.660
We have to make some sacrifices.

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:57.930
Luka-kun, Hotsuma-kun...

00:09:58.710 --> 00:10:00.600
What is going on?

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:03.180
Let me...

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:07.590
Let me go to Shusei-kun.

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:09.100
Please!

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:13.940
No. We can't send you
into an enemy trap.

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:16.930
Even if they're plotting something,
I have to go.

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:19.340
Yuki...

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:24.320
We'll protect Yuki,

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:26.930
even if it costs us our lives.

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:32.790
Boss, looks like you won't
be able to stop them.

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:35.820
Fine.

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:39.400
Takashiro-san.

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:44.430
But I'm going, too.

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.850
You're going?

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:50.400
To find them,

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:54.140
you'll need this symbol Ashley sent us.

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.970
It's an invitation for two.

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:59.400
Is it possible to bring a third?

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:02.110
If you rewrite the spell.

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:07.520
I'll break Ashley's barrier and
then catch up to you.

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:12.370
It will take some time, but don't do
anything reckless before I arrive.

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:13.320
Got it?

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:14.600
Understood.

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:19.550
Yuki and the others
should be leaving soon.

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:20.710
Yes.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:25.050
Please watch over them, Tsukumo.

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:27.680
Let's go.

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:28.840
Yeah.

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:29.690
Okay.

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:42.810
I always thought

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:47.100
I couldn't achieve my goals without
making some sacrifices.

00:11:47.900 --> 00:11:50.410
But he insists on the opposite idea.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:59.250
This is an amusement park...

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:10.670
This appears to be the
barrier they put up.

00:12:11.400 --> 00:12:13.100
Ridiculous!

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:16.470
Is Shusei-kun over there?

00:12:32.990 --> 00:12:35.200
That's God's Light.

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:38.420
He's pretty cute...

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:40.830
The other two aren't bad, either.

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:44.070
Not bad! Not bad!

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:47.030
I won't forgive them for breaking
the terms of the agreement,

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:49.930
but they'll all be part of my collection soon.

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:03.560
What's happening? A minute ago,
this was a ghost town.

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:06.390
We're inside Ashley's barrier.

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:08.930
This must be what she likes.

00:13:12.070 --> 00:13:16.240
I'm Mr. Rabbit. Have a balloon!

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:20.680
Unfortunate...

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:32.050
Already, huh?

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:41.480
This seems familiar.

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:44.880
Hotsuma, go on ahead with Yuki.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:49.030
Huh? You intend to take on
all these guys alone?

00:13:49.030 --> 00:13:51.130
Are you stupid?

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:52.480
What?

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:54.870
They're after Yuki.

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:58.470
And they've already half
completed their task.

00:13:58.470 --> 00:14:00.420
Don't you understand?

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:02.870
They'll have no reason to keep Shusei alive.

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:11.290
Look for the most conspicuous place here.
That's where you should find Ashley.

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.300
Conspicuous place...

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:18.510
If you've found it, then go.

00:14:18.510 --> 00:14:21.060
He's your partner, right?

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:23.920
Yuki, let's go.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:24.560
Right.

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:26.200
They're running away!

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:27.440
After them! After them!

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:32.650
Don't you want any of this?

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:34.320
Blood!

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:36.030
Blood of a high-ranking Duras!

00:14:36.030 --> 00:14:37.580
It'll make us stronger.

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:41.500
If you want it, come and get it.

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:13.780
Guess I'll be needing this now.

00:15:25.930 --> 00:15:27.740
Looks like they're going at it.

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:30.540
Can we join the fun now, Reiga-sama?

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:31.720
Not yet.

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:32.800
Huh?

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:35.640
Go to Ashley.

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:49.400
Gimme! Gimme!
I want the Opast blood!

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:51.400
Need to get a little farther.

00:15:58.030 --> 00:16:00.940
God's Light! Die!

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:03.080
Out of the way!

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:07.240
This way!

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:10.040
They're running! Follow them!

00:16:22.630 --> 00:16:23.930
Where are you,

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:26.090
Reiga?

00:16:26.890 --> 00:16:29.350
Where are they?

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:30.990
Find them!

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:38.380
Seems like they're gone.

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:40.860
Where am I?

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:44.880
I woke up here,
and I can't find my way out.

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:47.090
I'm being chased by freaks!

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:49.410
What's going on?

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:51.090
Kanata-san...

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:52.460
Yuki!

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:56.970
This place isn't normal.
Even I can see that.

00:16:56.970 --> 00:17:00.640
Tell me, Yuki.
What is this place?

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:01.930
Calm down.

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:07.060
I overheard your conversation.
You're like Yuki's brother, right?

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:08.580
Who are you?

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:10.640
I'm Yuki's friend.

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:14.750
Friend?

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:16.970
I'm sorry.

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:23.410
Yuki.

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:29.920
Yuki, what's happening to you?

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:31.870
Tell me.

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:34.620
Kanata-san.

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:56.240
Yuki...

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:59.390
Kanata-san, hide here.

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:02.140
Let's go, Hotsuma-kun.

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:02.860
Yeah.

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:05.030
Yuki!

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:07.950
Don't go! Stay with me!

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:09.950
Kanata-san...

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:13.960
Watch out!

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:27.640
I'll protect Yuki with my life!

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:37.690
<i>Creature of darkness,
burn in the fires of Hell!</i>

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:52.450
Hotsuma-kun.

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:55.270
Kanata-san.

00:18:55.270 --> 00:18:59.420
Don't go. You needn't
endanger yourself!

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:02.630
Come home with me, Yuki...

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:04.660
I'm sorry.

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:08.400
I have to save my friend.

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:13.700
I have to go...

00:19:26.030 --> 00:19:27.110
I always...

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:31.930
I always wanted to watch over you.

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:35.080
I thought of you as my brother.

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:38.580
Is that your answer,

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:42.000
Yuki?

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:45.510
Opast blood!

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.150
A delicacy!

00:19:47.150 --> 00:19:48.260
Delicious!

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:50.270
We never get to drink this!

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:51.930
Amazing! Amazing!

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:55.900
I think I gained a rank!

00:19:56.890 --> 00:19:58.670
What's going on? My body...

00:19:58.670 --> 00:19:59.650
I can't move!

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:00.850
It burns...

00:20:00.850 --> 00:20:02.520
Huh?

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:13.010
My blood's too strong for you.

00:20:13.910 --> 00:20:18.250
Blood of the Demon King
runs through my veins.

00:20:22.440 --> 00:20:23.490
Let's go.

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:24.670
Okay.

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:30.590
They're here.

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:35.100
Maybe I should go get them.

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:39.670
They seem to be struggling.

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:46.850
Hotsuma-kun, what's wrong?

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:49.610
That wound...

00:20:49.610 --> 00:20:51.330
I'm fine.

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:57.020
I can't rest when Shusei might be killed...

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:00.450
He's waiting!

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:04.020
Idiot, don't push yourself!

00:21:04.020 --> 00:21:04.880
I'm fine.

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:08.260
I want to save Shusei-kun, too.

00:21:12.650 --> 00:21:14.220
I'm all right.

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:18.640
Anyway, I've got this.

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:20.690
That's...

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:23.140
You held on to it?

00:21:23.140 --> 00:21:26.500
Sh-Shusei made me take it.

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:33.740
Besides, using this,
I can sense where he is.

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:41.870
Emotional reunion in...

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:43.330
three...

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:44.590
two...

00:21:44.590 --> 00:21:45.820
one...

00:21:46.210 --> 00:21:47.460
zero.

00:22:01.470 --> 00:22:02.900
Shusei!

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:37.640
Shusei, what about our summer pajamas?

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:41.710
Hotsuma, I've been meaning to tell you,
we don't need to match-

00:23:41.710 --> 00:23:45.910
What are you saying?
If we buy two, we get 20% off!

00:23:45.910 --> 00:23:46.100
To Be a "Pair"

00:23:46.100 --> 00:23:47.050
That's your reason?

00:23:47.050 --> 00:23:48.320
We're getting matching pillows, too!

00:23:48.320 --> 00:23:49.300
Fine.

00:23:49.300 --> 00:23:49.670
To Be a "Pair"
